  "notable_quotes": [
    "Hydroxide anions are required to complete and charge-balance the 3D Atz/acetate framework, creating rows of anionic charges along the pore walls.",
    "IISERP-MOF28 was synthesized solvothermally in DMF + water as a 3D Zn aminotriazolato acetato hydroxide framework.",
    "The MOF has high calculated CO2/N2 selectivity, reaching 75 at 298 K and 150 at 313 K for a 15:85 CO2:N2 mixture."
